            "description": "username: 3-50 of letters, digits, `.` `_` `-`. password: 8-100 chars. role: USER (default) or ADMIN. 400 if the username exists. Creates a real account in the shared database. Fill `newUserPassword` first.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"new-user\",\n  \"password\": \"{{newUserPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"USER\"\n}",
              "options": {
